# start Validation Reply Form
_vrf_PLAT241_mc4pb_plate_rt
;
PROBLEM: High   'MainMol' Ueq as Compared to Neighbors of         C9 Check 
RESPONSE: The difference is due to temperature-induced vibrations of the carbon atom that is away from the tethering ammonium group. While such differences can be removed by constrained refinement, in the authors' view, these anisotropic displacement parameters represent true nature of these hybrid structures at room temperature.
;
_vrf_PLAT411_mc4pb_plate_rt
;
PROBLEM: Short Inter H...H Contact  H6B      ..H9A      .       1.99 Ang.  
RESPONSE: The short distance is due to temperature-induced vibrations of the carbon atoms that are away from the tethering ammonium group to which these hydrogen atoms are bonded. 
;
